activity-continuity = Portable Activity continuity
activity-continuity-safe-contents = Continuity v1 contains only the goal’s title, goal text, completion criteria, planning boundaries, canonical App object references, execution-limit settings, scheduling priority, lineage, and an integrity digest.
activity-continuity-non-goals = This is not live sync or backup/restore. Credentials, grants, approvals, capability policy, monetary settings or ledger, Jobs, Sessions, receipts, effects, results, object state or history, notifications, audit evidence, and execution proof do not migrate. Import never changes the source Activity.
activity-continuity-copy-paste-only = No vetted native file dialog is used here. Export is copied as bounded JSON, and import accepts bounded pasted JSON only; this UI performs no filesystem access and stores no continuity data locally.
